raph","text":"そして我が家のワンも元気ダヨ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/01/04/3573224/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/01/04/3573224/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"銀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/01/04/3573224/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クッキー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2015/01/04/3573224/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもみさを応援してるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれてるようで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコとクッキーはもうおばあちゃんで、あと何回会えるんだろうね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特にチョコは私が飼いたいって言って飼った犬なのに 私は東京に行っちゃって...自分勝手だよなぁって自分で思う(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも 犬は何も喋れないけど、私が帰ってくると1番に喜んでくれてずっと私の帰りを待ってくれてるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから帰省した時は友達や家族の時間と同じくらい、犬との時間も大切にしています▽・x・▽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src"